{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "d38ed2796c833ca35f9bb546771493073c129f8f08c64ee7dd4c5f3a5b05544d", "ja": "スタートダッシュ", "zh": "起步冲刺", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aa73b05ba7fc0f68698fbbc3a768f60d86323813ced0141fa002168727568732", "ja": "対決が本格的にスタートし、朝から早起きで\nポイントを狙う響と環。近所の人にちゃんと\n挨拶をする響、ゴミ拾いをする環、それぞれ\nポイントゲット。自分なりに、色々なやり方\nでいいと理解し、育もやる気を見せる。", "zh": "对决正式拉开帷幕，响和环一大早就\n早早起床赚取积分。响好好向附近的\n街坊打招呼，环捡拾垃圾，各自都\n拿到了积分。育也明白用适合自己的\n各种方式就好，开始干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "80a33165cc84a4e1b9bbf684bac6b27b9acf2b4e2bfbb881bcd024bf3366cc3b", "ja": "（BOTの『いい子対決』が本格スタート。こっちも、\nいつでも撮影できるように準備しておかないとだな）", "zh": "（BOT的“乖孩子对决”正式开始了。我们这边也得做好准备，随时都能拍摄才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "606d5559f0056b236ebb7e3d2652bfc0ea6e0dcc56d4fd4a4891a8803025ff21", "ja": "おはようございまーす！！", "zh": "大家早上好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "606d5559f0056b236ebb7e3d2652bfc0ea6e0dcc56d4fd4a4891a8803025ff21", "ja": "おはようございまーす！！", "zh": "大家早上好——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a46d09e55f36c478f787f3ea345998ce09a52bf053b41c64bc08ab737cacf624", "ja": "おお、響と環か。\nおはよう。", "zh": "哦，是响和环啊。\n早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "025aa44441813afe4134f58ed1dc47b7da72b1a57114823f6ff03bf01cc3588f", "ja": "ずいぶん早い時間だけど……\nふたりとも、仕事は午後からじゃなかったか？", "zh": "时间还早着呢……\n你们两个的工作不是从下午开始吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "e38d3783f25aa6e6a73f8bdd67390446286956ec9a0396fc84e093ab7399981a", "ja": "{$P$}、忘れてない？\n自分達は、いま勝負の真っ最中さー！", "zh": "{$P$}，没忘吧？\n我们现在正比得热火朝天呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4e305b077f2c41a9c627976619745e3cb828aff70a075556d4241daf02d6af2c", "ja": "たまき、早起き得意だから！\n朝練で『いい子ポイント』を集めるんだー！", "zh": "环，最擅长早起了！\n要通过晨练收集“乖孩子积分”——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4d19625b435be53a8cc43553a981e7cd04afd593ce34c8c02997f905acceee04", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\n確かに、朝早くから頑張るのはいい子だな！", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n确实，一大早就努力，真是个乖孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "b75230963e6ef50a0045c62cf4a36954e4a2406d6069525873c4ecb84567fdcc", "ja": "ひびきも、たまきと同じこと考えてたんだって！\nだから時間をあわせて、いっしょにきたんだ！", "zh": "原来响也和环想的是一样的事情！\n所以我们就对好了时间，一起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "0472611084fd3ff813111b2632735f1361b5d387f91c68f8a1484296aea95af3", "ja": "環が相手なら、面白い勝負になりそうだからね！\n環、早速、表に出て勝負だぞ！", "zh": "如果对手是环，肯定会是一场有趣的较量！\n环，我们马上出去一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5a70353f055368090fd6777f504d9562c2b99396ce24a459e1b72a8c7523ba21", "ja": "ああ、もう行っちゃった！\n撮影もしなくちゃだから、機材の用意をしてと……。", "zh": "啊，已经走掉了！\n还得拍摄呢，先把设备准备好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "e00658040d9c73a1adb357acdc84b2aa9562de77dc83f7d380aaba4d40ad30c7", "ja": "おはようございます！\n{$P$}さん、もう撮影始めるの？", "zh": "早上好！\n{$P$}先生，已经要开始拍摄了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f331fcf10ea4921a258609f78264695b796d31593c0d6efd5aa2835d36246c6d", "ja": "おはよう、育。そうなんだ。\n育は今日は、歌のレッスンだったな。", "zh": "早上好，育。是啊。\n育今天是上声乐课吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "3a66ea3a625ab1c7a0a62688ca187faebb8d4fdaf8743698dd20233ffc29aafb", "ja": "うん！　えっと……\n今の、響さんと環ちゃんだったよね？", "zh": "嗯！那个……\n刚才的是响姐姐和环吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "033a45bef762de916d87ea944b95153766b906a216ece2cf947a56bd9df74520", "ja": "ああ。朝練で勝負するために、早起きしてきたらしい。\n育も、一緒に行ってみるか？", "zh": "嗯。听说她们是为了在晨练中一决胜负，特意早起过来的。\n育也要一起去看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "c5ad468f2dc2db2829cb328a752025204dd011b2730456841de7041f3d37d7d7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nあっちのほうに、響さんが小さく見えるよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那边能看到响姐小小的身影哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ade5b55c7636b893dac0a5be95851b86f04d1598d02543182649b1de5364af0d", "ja": "本当だ。思ったよりも遠くに行ってないな。\n割とスローペースな……。", "zh": "确实。没跑到比想象中更远的地方。  \n速度还挺慢的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "dc7811bc2a3082542c1569d88e2c8a339b98a65790a104bc40606b91f25b7f06", "ja": "うん。てっきり、すごいスピードで\n走ってるのかと思ったけど……。", "zh": "嗯。我还以为它正以惊人的速度\n奔跑呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "437e55fc7dbda2800282380cb7ad546391a26e24d98573e05fa794947fdf994f", "ja": "おはようございまーす！\nサモエドのサモ郎も、おはよ！", "zh": "早上好——！\n萨摩耶的萨摩郎，也早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1020_inu", "source_sha256": "47e49fa161832b39f5d5e02ee24a0dde4d302a1d3fbbe02b4e7b660eb7e6ea08", "ja": "ワンワン！", "zh": "汪汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "13214bf16538232948a3d930d89bb3cecf8f5ac167298e67b492e810384fc150", "ja": "うん、おはよう！\n今日もいい天気だねー！", "zh": "嗯，早上好！\n今天也是个好天气呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "99a6063dac717c49540215e5bf0a69ff190bdc457a6495a288cff0177161e3a6", "ja": "む……えらいぞ響！\n道行く近所の人に挨拶をしてるんだな。", "zh": "嗯……真了不起啊，响！\n还特意跟路过的街坊邻居打招呼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "3569eb56c3b0ba3e323967474db4c9fa852a4c52e40d6a648af4f807b9d94d2d", "ja": "え？\n挨拶なんて、別に普通じゃない……？", "zh": "诶？\n打招呼什么的，不是很普通吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "c26c962af92fd31bd96dee35eeae0ae3454423fa6603bf261433921605dfec4b", "ja": "あいさつする子はえらいんだよ！\nわたし、学校でいつもほめられるもん！", "zh": "会打招呼的孩子才是好孩子哦！\n我在学校里总是会被表扬呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f1e39641a85869ace147846aaa4f46d3de68f41466ed927424432cdc55af6f55", "ja": "育の言う通りだ。挨拶という基礎を\n疎かにしない……とてもいい子だ！", "zh": "不能疏忽问候这个基础……真是个好孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "46288e619a474ea2b16ada843bee05e63e3e85e1252e5a90d99b623cfd009871", "ja": "響は『いい子ポイント』獲得だな。\nこれからも頑張って集めてくれ！", "zh": "响获得“好孩子积分”了。今后也继续努力收集吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "8de38737cf6766238897e7bf574fc050422e3e748a2243a9794c11c886316d12", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？　やったー！\n自分がポイントゲット、一番乗りさー！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？太好了！\n我拿到积分啦，第一个哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "234e14efe7917e4090b4cc1851091fc01904cc5c740a9429efcd9501b3f71d72", "ja": "そういえば、響さんといっしょに出たはずの\n環ちゃんがどこにもいないような……？", "zh": "说起来，本来应该和响姐姐一起出场的环，好像哪儿都不见了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "cd2be1e2b794098380e7d36d7d2d22a766f56fd860a65d86231e8e72a94959e9", "ja": "確かに。\n環が遅れをとるとは考えにくいけど……。", "zh": "确实。\n环落后于人，这倒是难以想象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "e050ed782670b4401da443b73af194fc9a8c259394fd05da6ea2a125b8caa161", "ja": "あ、みんないる！\nたまきの本気、見せちゃうぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "啊，大家都在！\n就让你们看看小环的认真吧～！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "fbc7688dfc65207d6c685ec8b302cb03585968c3bcaa6f10dd78ca91a2cf4bea", "ja": "環、遅かったのはなんでなんだ？\n？　そのポケットに入ってるのは……。", "zh": "环，你为什么来晚了？\n咦？你口袋里装的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "70051048b97460d39e56ed22e7b47dfa1cdfbf66db261548b92a8846e2ab05cb", "ja": "ゴミ袋！　朝、おうちの前を走るときは、\nゴミ拾いしながらやるんだ！　だから！", "zh": "垃圾袋！早上在家门前跑步时，会边捡垃圾边跑的！\n所以才会带着它嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "531f88e57cfd0939947f57a7f68438b0bb485455777be62fb93b69eb809468e8", "ja": "なるほど……素晴らしい心がけだ！\n環にも文句なしの『いい子ポイント』だ！", "zh": "原来如此……真是了不起的心态！\n环绝对可以拿到“好孩子积分”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "41f0dcc274da1388288cf24ea159b2869a2a792be70f69a3683631c148e9d79a", "ja": "わー！　やったー！\nたまき、何もしてないのにポイントもらえたぞ～！", "zh": "哇！成功啦——！\n环明明什么都没做，却也拿到积分了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "1903f426932425605885b48727f5eb75aeb940ba7fd0af4a06bcd6da3cd85f57", "ja": "やっぱり、環は追いついてきたね……。\n勝負はこうじゃないと盛り上がらないさー！", "zh": "果然，环追上来了呢……  \n比赛就该这样才有意思嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1036_030iku", "source_sha256": "6de858cab32989fa972fa18c3f72b1e9ceeac8cbb7d683dd90b7d9ea6e9323c3", "ja": "あいさつができるいい子に、\nおそうじをするいい子……。", "zh": "会打招呼的好孩子，\n会打扫的好孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_02_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "ce72e01849000c82ff63189c6474197cc4b963cc942fbec0090dcbb733ecbdb3", "ja": "そっか。いろんないい子で、\nポイントをもらっていけばいいんだね！", "zh": "这样啊。只要做各种各样的好孩子，就能拿到积分了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
